  "2026-08-30T20:38:01.551Z",pi-agent,"Greptile 3890423554 reproduced. With only scripts/verify-release-publish-attestation.ts reverted to 0cbdb8d, the dynamic failure counts were [1,1,1,1,1,0] instead of [1,1,1,1,1,1], SOURCE_ONLY_REVERT_EXIT=1. Restored source recognizes two leading unresolved scalar expressions on the original command candidate even when ordinary arguments follow, without reintroducing false failures in the real workflow. npm test passed 420/420; coverage is 100% lines/branches/functions; docstring, typecheck, and the real workflow verifier pass."
